# SWING TRADING ASSET SELECTION SYSTEM
# Weekly & Monthly Setup Finder — Complete Financial Specification

Pipeline: Regime Detection → Universe Filter → Trend → Momentum → Volume → Pattern → Score → R:R

---

## SECTION 1: HIGH-LEVEL WORKFLOW

This system is a top-down funnel. Never scan randomly. Reduce the universe step-by-step. Only take assets that survive every layer AND have clean price structure.

### WEEKLY (Weekend — build watchlist)
1. Classify market regime (bull / bear / neutral) + VIX level
2. Download universe (S&P 500 or Nasdaq 100)
3. Apply hard filters: liquidity, price, ATR%, trend alignment, RSI, ADX
4. Detect patterns algorithmically: breakout / pullback / BB squeeze
5. Score and rank all passing tickers via composite weighted score
6. Keep top 10–20 as the weekly watchlist

### DAILY (Each Evening — maintain watchlist)
1. Re-download updated daily candles, re-score
2. Flag watchlist names that triggered an entry setup today
3. Check earnings calendar — exclude any name reporting within 5–7 trading days
4. Visually review top 5 candidates on a chart

### MORNING (Before open)
1. Check pre-market gaps — drop anything gapping hard against your direction
2. Confirm no adverse overnight news on candidates
3. Set limit order at entry, stop price, and target price before market opens

