## SECTION 9: DATA SOURCE NOTES (Interactive Brokers / ib_async)

The system requires the following data via IB API:
- Historical daily OHLCV bars for each ticker (1 year minimum, 252+ bars)
- Historical daily bars for SPY (benchmark) and VIX (^VIX)
- Real-time or delayed quotes for pre-market gap checks
- Contract definitions for each ticker (STK, SMART, USD)
- Optional: fundamental data for earnings date lookup

IB bar size for daily data: "1 day"
IB duration for 1 year: "1 Y"
IB whatToShow: "TRADES" for price/volume, "HISTORICAL_VOLATILITY" optional
VIX ticker in IB: contract type IND, symbol "VIX", exchange "CBOE"

Rate limiting: IB allows approximately 50 historical data requests per 10 minutes.
Batch requests with delays between calls to avoid pacing violations.